/// of requests exceeded your throughput limit. For more information about
/// throughput quotas in Amazon Textract, see Default quotas in Amazon
/// Textract . PAGE_CHARACTERS_EXCEEDED - Too many text characters on the
/// page (10,000 characters maximum). PAGE_SIZE_EXCEEDED - The maximum page
/// size is 10 MB. INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR - The request encountered a service
/// issue. Try the API request again.
